ar, docking clamp).<br>\t- 6 types of mining equipment.<br>\t- 9 life-support facilities.<br>\t- 5 emergency rooms.<br></li><li>24 Missions for standard operation, emergencies and hostile encounters to test your ship in Crew Management.</li></ul>","developers":["Coronado Games"],"dlc":[926590],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/292330/header.jpg?t=1772808489","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Starship Corporation \u00a9 2016 Coronado Games. Developed by Coronado Games. Licensed worldwide to and published by Iceberg Interactive B.V. All brands, product names, and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners. All rights reserved. Made in Germany.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161173/7de3791354b49fb5fc2a5174f53e5ee77a4a5140/1751260089/dash_av1.mpd?t=1525361618","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161173/7de3791354b49fb5fc2a5174f53e5ee77a4a5140/1751260089/dash_h264.mpd?t=1525361618","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161173/7de3791354b49fb5fc2a5174f53e5ee77a4a5140/1751260089/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1525361618","id":256715893,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256715893/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1525361618"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161171/1d252d72bf3787e7388104e0b25d6cd05abd6f90/1751260088/dash_av1.mpd?t=1525361630","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161171/1d252d72bf3787e7388104e0b25d6cd05abd6f90/1751260088/dash_h264.mpd?t=1525361630","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292330/161171/1d252d72bf3787e7388104e0